# Chameleon, Master of Disguise (2/3, {3}{U}): "You may have Chameleon enter as a copy of a creature you control, except his name is Chameleon,
# Master of Disguise." Black Lotus (UUU) and a Mox Ruby pay for it; with Ornithopter the only creature he can copy, he enters as a 0/2
# flier (CR 707.2) that keeps his own name (CR 707.9b).

